{
  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-343878",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We assume that a solution of our equation has the following Fourier series:\n\n$$\n{y}_{p}∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}).\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p}^{′} & ∼\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}))∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }-{a}_{n}\\frac{n\\pi }{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}) \\\\ {y}_{p}^{″} & ∼\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }-{a}_{n}\\frac{n\\pi }{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}))∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }-{a}_{n}\\frac{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}{9}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the expressions for ${y}_{p}^{″}$ and ${y}_{p}$ into the equation and have\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }-{a}_{n}\\frac{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}{9}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})+36({\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}))={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{3(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}).\n$$\n\nRearranging the terms to find a common denominator:\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}(36-\\frac{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}{9})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{3(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})\n$$\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}(\\frac{324-{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}{9})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{3(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}).\n$$\n\nNow, equating the cosine coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{a}_{n}(324-{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2})}{9}=\\frac{3(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}}\\,⇒\\,{a}_{n}=\\frac{27(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}(324-{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2})}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our particular solution is\n\n$$\n{y}_{p}∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,\\frac{27(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}(324-{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2})}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}).\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
